.426,0.908,0.975,0.533,0.413,0.799,0.473,0.387,0.877,0.389,0.377,0.599,0.757,0.264,0.67,0.968,0.728,0.401,0.327,0.149,0.11,0.064,0.409,0.379,0.206,0.177,0.19,0.204,0.159,0.106],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"MARTINE: Perhaps the potion was his. Did we check his ‘tea kit’?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.448,"end":4.896,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"large":{"start":0.448,"end":4.896,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"CYE: We haven't found, let alone checked, one, but the test results show this was bad juice. Most commonly on black market shelves, it causes fits of negative emotions. If someone slipped it into his drink shortly before he died…","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":5.376,"end":18.944,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":40},"large":{"start":5.376,"end":19.0,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":40},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"MARTINE: It would still take an enormous amount of luck to make Farron fall in the right spot.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":19.168,"end":23.04,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":18},"large":{"start":19.168,"end":23.04,"frac":0.944,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":18},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"CYE: Exactly! There’re too many coincidences for our culprit to have relied on Lady Luck alone: The failing emergency brakes, the unsigned maintenance; none of that is in Niyam’s sphere of influence.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":23.328,"end":33.312,"frac":0.969,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":32},"large":{"start":23.328,"end":33.312,"frac":0.969,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":32},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"MARTINE: He could’ve gotten help. Reportedly, Niyam was a regular customer in fate-reading circles, including the victim’s. Someone could’ve given him the tools and knowledge he needed.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":33.792,"end":43.456,"frac":0.75,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":28},"large":{"start":33.792,"end":43.456,"frac":0.821,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":28},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"CYE: From your tone I’m guessing they were all unlicensed fate-readings?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":44.128,"end":48.256,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"large":{"start":44.128,"end":48.256,"frac":0.917,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":12},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"MARTINE: Correct. Licensed fate-readers enforce a cool-down period to prevent clients from becoming overly reliant on seercraft. Unlicensed fate-readers don’t keep records. It’d be easy for Niyam to hide that Augustine is not the first unlicensed seer to ‘pass on’ after giving him a reading. With some digging I’m sure we could link him to other recent seer deaths.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":48.608,"end":68.736,"frac":0.935,"status":"ok","matched":58,"words":62},"large":{"start":48.608,"end":68.736,"frac":0.968,"status":"ok","matched":60,"words":62},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"CYE: These seers…they were already closed by the Department of Prophecy Crime as suicides, correct? Are we reopening them?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":69.184,"end":77.088,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":20},"large":{"start":69.184,"end":77.088,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":20},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"MARTINE: It depends...on the results of this case.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":77.696,"end":81.1,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"large":{"start":77.696,"end":81.44,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"CYE: Yet another reason to crack the case immediately! Which leads me to our mysterious witness statement from Artura McQueen…I see they were either a book heroine made flesh or a literary fan. I still wish you had contacted me when she came in.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":81.824,"end":95.872,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":45},"large":{"start":81.824,"end":95.872,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":45},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"MARTINE: Snopes, we get liars everyday. You were busy chasing down Niyam, an increasingly likely murderer. She just seems like an attention-seeking distraction.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":96.256,"end":106.02,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":24},"large":{"start":96.256,"end":106.52,"frac":0.958,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":24},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"CYE: And now she’s gone, replaced by a voice on the airwaves claiming Farron did not die of suicide but murder.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":106.816,"end":113.184,"frac":0.952,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":21},"large":{"start":106.816,"end":113.0,"frac":0.952,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":21},"differ":false},{"i":12,"text":"MARTINE: Which we may have concluded without the public setting the department’s amulet network on fire. The protests will only get worse if she goes through with her threats to drop more seer stories.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":113.504,"end":124.448,"frac":0.971,"status":"ok","matched":33,"words":34},"large":{"start":113.504,"end":124.448,"frac":0.971,"status":"ok","matched":33,"words":34},"differ":false},{"i":13,"text":"CYE: Threat is a strong word, it sounded more like a schedule. Regardless, I can’t in good conscience say Niyam is the mastermind when so much of the truth eludes us.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":124.832,"end":135.616,"frac":0.968,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":31},"large":{"start":124.832,"end":135.616,"frac":0.968,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":31},"differ":false},{"i":14,"text":"MARTINE: The higher-ups won’t wait forever. What if we held him for a day or two for questioning? Tonight’s the anniversary of the Severing. It would get them off our backs.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":136.16,"end":145.152,"frac":0.906,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":32},"large":{"start":136.16,"end":145.152,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":32},"differ":false},{"i":15,"text":"CYE: A solid back-up plan Number 2. Can you keep the powers-that-be at bay a little longer?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":145.6,"end":151.232,"frac":0.85,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":20},"large":{"start":145.6,"end":151.232,"frac":0.85,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":20},"differ":false},{"i":16,"text":"MARTINE: I’ll do my best. Where are you heading off to?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":151.616,"end":154.08,"frac":0.909,"status":"ok","matched":10,"words":11},"large":{"start":151.616,"end":154.06,"frac":0.909,"status":"ok","matched":10,"words":11},"differ":false},{"i":17,"text":"CYE: I’d like to track down our mysterious Archivist B aka Artura McQueen. She uncovered info about Farron’s death that we missed, and I‘ve an idea on how to find her. She accepts submissions from listeners who crack the code to her secret mailbox address.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":154.432,"end":169.376,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":45},"large":{"start":154.432,"end":169.376,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":45},"differ":false},{"i":18,"text":"MARTINE: That weeds out the spam, I’ll give her that. But she’s a civilian , and a troublemaking one at that. [sigh] You’ve already figured out the audio code haven’t you?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":169.76,"end":180.128,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":30},"large":{"start":169.76,"end":179.98,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":30},"differ":false},{"i":19,"text":"CYE: It was a fun little mystery! It’s based on intentional vs atmospheric audio pops–nevermind I’ll show you later. Until then, file with grace, dear Martinnnne, my desk-bound queen.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":180.352,"end":194.16,"frac":0.903,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":31},"large":{"start":180.352,"end":193.94,"frac":0.935,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":31},"differ":false},{"i":20,"text":"MARTINE: [laughs] Ha! Don’t flirt with me if you don’t mean it, darling. Go on, git!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":195.936,"end":200.72,"frac":0.75,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":16},"large":{"start":195.936,"end":202.112,"frac":0.75,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":16},"differ":true},{"i":21,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye laughs and waves at his partner as he heads off to stake out the mailbox.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":201.184,"end":206.432,"frac":0.882,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":17},"large":{"start":202.304,"end":206.432,"frac":0.882,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":17},"differ":true}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6d97cb455c_5-1c.jpg"}